The second part will contain the probabilities and the conditionals. in this section, the player has a random chance of winning or losing based on amount wished to win within a boolean (e.g. if winProfit is &gt; 150%, then your chances of winning are somewhere between 15-10%. if winProfit is &lt; 150%, then chances of winning significantly increase to 50-30%, and so on and so forth)
</comment><comment id="z:.J~6B9zWh3L3_K[=nv" x="2361" y="0" w="348" h="137">the "win" condition will be in a relational Boolean, saying targetMoney must be at least whatever amount the user stated at the start</comment><block type="gameSplash" id="N9,)/StlQ=pSS07In^uj" disabled-reasons="pxt_automatic_disabled" x="433" y="-103"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" _expanded="0" _input_init="true"></mutation><value name="title"><shadow type="text" id="weL)k%r^l_+c2@2+x|hY" disabled-reasons="pxt_automatic_disabled"><field name="TEXT">We have some simple rules before you can start gambling.</field></shadow></value><value name="subtitle"><shadow type="text" id="6zt_i@e%^c+)g%F=Xd{I" disabled-reasons="pxt_automatic_disabled"><field name="TEXT"></field></shadow></value></block><block type="pxt-on-start" id="^(1vqhZhmg$bN/xf+[%V" x="0" y="0"><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="variables_set" id="v#(pqx=nL3z!xZF9nhxJ"><field name="VAR" id="CB6}631:suWC/`d=~qb$">moneyTotal</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">This entire code will repeat until said target score is met (the user will be able to set this if they wish)</comment><data>0;1;2</data><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="RT-/0_1qal1`%!#n.PI7"><field name="NUM">1000</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="p$w$iA1k!.nMnj9741Gn"><field name="VAR" id="IlmSwXQzZ0D:e_0XmB0H">mySprite</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="L(j=_(JF75AWPDZ=1{5h"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="spritescreate" id="6v5GG%hGp-Qc(%)+0);$"><value name="img"><shadow type="screen_image_picker" id="i%hR$K2C+evwxDjn)0y`"><field name="img">img`
